\pard Abstract\par

\pard\li284 This specification defines a lossless compressed data format that compresses data using a combinationn of the LZ77 algorithm and Huffman coding, with efficiency comparable to the best currectly available general-purpose compression methods. The data can be produced or consumed, even for an arbitrarily long sequentially presented input data stream, using only an a priori bounded amount of intermediate storage. The format can be implemented readily in a manner not covered by patents.\par

